zig-detour is a translation to Zig of Detour, DetourCrowd and DetourTileCache,
from recastnavigation 1.6.0
(https://github.com/recastnavigation/recastnavigation). It is an altered
version of the original software: the code is rewritten in Zig, with its own
interface. The translation is licensed under the same terms as the original.

